---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Ruijie Wu — Returning to the living body" description="Psychotherapy, embodied practice, dance movement and writing by Ruijie Wu.">
  <section class="hero container">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Psychotherapy · Embodiment · Movement</span>
        <h1>Returning to<br /><em>the living body.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">A space for listening to the body, making sense of experience, and discovering new possibilities for being in the world.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/about">A little about me <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <aside class="hero-note">
        <em>“The body is not an object we carry. It is a way we meet the world.”</em>
        <span>Notes on practice, presence and becoming.</span>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">An evolving practice</span><h2>Ways of working</h2></div>
        <p>Different paths into experience, held with curiosity and care.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Psychotherapy</h3><p>A thoughtful space for emotional life, relationships, loss, change and meaning.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Embodied approaches</h3><p>Attending to sensation, movement and the knowledge that emerges through the body.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="number">03</span><h3>Learning together</h3><p>Workshops and teaching at the meeting point of psychology, movement and creativity.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="narrow">
      <span class="eyebrow">A guiding thought</span>
      <p class="statement">Not everything needs to be fixed. Sometimes we need a place where experience can unfold, take shape, and be met differently.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/writing">Explore the writing <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
